From c52c72e209d96dab89a761fa00f432c966740655 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI Lab <83042094+MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:37:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] inkling2: fuse decode K/V conv into prep
 (TF_INKLING2_DECODE_KV_CONV_PREP)

Fuse K and V 4-tap convolutions (static and dynamic) with clip/RMS and
KV cache writes into tf_ink2_prep_conv{,8}, running alongside Q/rel prep
in one launch per decode visit. Eliminates 96 conv launches and scratch
round-trips per decode round while preserving rollback history and exact
non-FMA conv rounding. Controlled by TF_INKLING2_DECODE_KV_CONV_PREP
(default on).

Exactness: 6/6 ex.sh cells pass (30/30 rows identical to s3_base),
48/48 A-B-B-A token SHAs identical.
dec8 A-B-B-A: plain1 +0.95% (42.2 -> 42.6), greedy1 +0.68% (59.6 -> 60.0),
bench1 +0.46% (60.6 -> 60.9), bench2 +0.57% (82.7 -> 83.2),
bench4 +0.45% (115.9 -> 116.5), bench8 +0.00%, live8 +0.34% (148.2 -> 148.7).
